## Client (`/app/game_client.py`)
```python
from game_client import GameClient

game = GameClient()
spec = game.spec()                        # action schema and session limits
print(spec["action_schema"])              # show the accepted action format
obs = game.observe()                      # one current snapshot without spending an action
print(obs["step"], obs["done"])           # accepted actions so far and whether the episode ended
if not obs["done"]:
    print(obs["observation"])             # replace with task-specific decoding or field access

